<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! *sniff*\nGood of you to come all this way!\rWhat you think of the Kanto Hustlers?\nTough, huh? We built different over\fhere.\fPants optional.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! *sniff*\nGood of you to come all this way!\rWhat you think of the Kanto Hustlers?\nTough, huh? We built different over\fhere.\fPants optional.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you in the area, come visit again.\nKnock first. I’m usually... relaxed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You never stop amazin’ me!\rYou finished the National\nPokédex? That’s WAY past what I hoped!\rMeetin’ you is somethin’ I’ma\ncherish my whole life!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You never stop amazin’ me!\rYou finished the National\nPokédex? That’s WAY past what I hoped!\rMeetin’ you is somethin’ I’ma\ncherish my whole life!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Those Chains is...\rSheesh! You ain’t just the\nJohto Kingpin, you got\fall the Kanto Chains too! Well done!\rHmm... No wonder I sensed somethin’\nin you when we met.\rTell you what, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rI’ma set it up so you can\ngo to Mt. Silver.\rMt. Silver a big mountain that’s\nhome to mad wild homies.\rIt’s too dangerous for your average\nHustler, so it’s off limits.\rBut we can make a exception for\nyou, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rGo to the Big League\nReception Gate.\rYou can get to Mt. Silver from there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Those Chains is...\rSheesh! You ain’t just the\nJohto Kingpin, you got\fall the Kanto Chains too! Well done!\rHmm... No wonder I sensed somethin’\nin you when we met.\rTell you what, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rI’ma set it up so you can\ngo to Mt. Silver.\rMt. Silver a big mountain that’s\nhome to mad wild homies.\rIt’s too dangerous for your average\nHustler, so it’s off limits.\rBut we can make a exception for\nyou, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rGo to the Big League\nReception Gate.\rYou can get to Mt. Silver from there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Hmm? You ain’t\ncollectin’ Kanto Block Chains?\rKanto’s Block Bosses is just as tough\nas the ones in Johto.\fI recommend you challenge ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Ah, you collectin’\nKanto Block Chains.\rI bet it’s hard, but the\nexperience gon’ help you.\rCome see me when you got ’em all.\nI’ll have a gift for you.\fKeep it up, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Ah, you collectin’\nKanto Block Chains.\rI bet it’s hard, but the\nexperience gon’ help you.\rCome see me when you got ’em all.\nI’ll have a gift for you.\fKeep it up, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWhat brings you here?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWhat brings you here?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: The legendary homies\nfrom the Hoenn myth?\rYou must be talkin’ about KYOGRE\nand GROUDON!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: The Embedded Tower is\nprob’ly the ruins that got somethin’\fto do with the Hoenn myth.\fIf so, the other one gotta be around.\rThey say KYOGRE and GROUDON\nshaped the seas and the land!\rWhere those two at, the other homie\nsupposed to show up too...\fAll this is real possible!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Easy to imagine the\nRed Orb gon’ make GROUDON\fshow up at the Embedded Tower...\rBut accordin’ to Mr. Pokémon,\nGROUDON don’t show itself to\fHustlers with golden hearts, only\fto ones with shinin’-silver spirits.\rIt might be hard for you alone to\npull this off, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rBut if you get a GROUDON\nfrom the Embedded Tower,\rcome show me both\nlegendary homies!\rThen I’ll tell you the rest of\nthe Hoenn myth!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Easy to imagine the\nRed Orb gon’ make GROUDON\fshow up at the Embedded Tower...\rBut accordin’ to Mr. Pokémon,\nGROUDON don’t show itself to\fHustlers with golden hearts, only\fto ones with shinin’-silver spirits.\rIt might be hard for you alone to\npull this off, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rBut if you get a GROUDON\nfrom the Embedded Tower,\rcome show me both\nlegendary homies!\rThen I’ll tell you the rest of\nthe Hoenn myth!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Easy to imagine the\nBlue Orb gon’ make KYOGRE\fshow up at the Embedded Tower...\rBut accordin’ to Mr. Pokémon,\nKYOGRE don’t show itself to\fHustlers with shinin’-silver spirits,\fonly to ones with golden hearts.\rIt might be hard for you alone to\npull this off, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rBut if you get a KYOGRE\nfrom the Embedded Tower,\rcome show me both\nlegendary homies!\rThen I’ll tell you the rest\nof the Hoenn myth!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Easy to imagine the\nBlue Orb gon’ make KYOGRE\fshow up at the Embedded Tower...\rBut accordin’ to Mr. Pokémon,\nKYOGRE don’t show itself to\fHustlers with shinin’-silver spirits,\fonly to ones with golden hearts.\rIt might be hard for you alone to\npull this off, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\rBut if you get a KYOGRE\nfrom the Embedded Tower,\rcome show me both\nlegendary homies!\rThen I’ll tell you the rest\nof the Hoenn myth!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You did it,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fYou caught KYOGRE AND GROUDON!\fAight!\fI wanna trust you with this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You did it,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fYou caught KYOGRE AND GROUDON!\fAight!\fI wanna trust you with this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: It look like the Orb\nyou got from Mr. Pokémon,\fdon’t it?\rIt’s called the Jade Orb.\nIt got somethin’ to do with RAYQUAZA.\rLegend say the beef\nbetween GROUDON and KYOGRE\fshaped the land and seas of Hoenn.\rVolcanoes and giant waves\nsupposedly changed the\fwhole shape of the land.\rBut then RAYQUAZA came down to\nbreak up the fight.\rIt’s a homie that run the skies!\rIf the Embedded Tower is tied to\nKYOGRE and GROUDON,\rthen goin’ there with that Jade Orb\ngon’ make somethin’ happen.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Go to the Embedded\nTower with the Jade Orb!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You caught\nRAYQUAZA!\rThe power of the Jade Orb\nmusta pulled RAYQUAZA there!\rHomies sometimes get real\nattracted to certain Orbs and Stones.\fNobody know why.\rMaybe memories from ancient times...\fwhen this planet was born...\fand homies too...\fmake homies act that way.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThe study of homies never end.\rIt’s pure joy to work toward\nperfection!\rBy the way...\rHmm? Those homies!\fThey was at the Embedded Tower?\rThat’s KYOGRE and GROUDON--\nthe homies from the Hoenn myth!\rI never dreamed you’d catch\nhomies like that...\rYou proved yourself worthy!\nCongrats!\rI wanna trust you with this,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThe study of homies never end.\rIt’s pure joy to work toward\nperfection!\rBy the way...\rHmm? Those homies!\fThey was at the Embedded Tower?\rThat’s KYOGRE and GROUDON--\nthe homies from the Hoenn myth!\rI never dreamed you’d catch\nhomies like that...\rYou proved yourself worthy!\nCongrats!\rI wanna trust you with this,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Here, take this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Say!\nWanna take a pic\fwith me for a change? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You will? Good!\nYou ready?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Yes!\nThat’s a good memory!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: For real?\nNo need to be shy...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Photo Album full.\rGo on your PC and delete\nsome pics.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Professor’s Homie Talk radio show\nair here AND in Johto.\rProfessor Oak is SO...HARD! He just\ndon’t wear pants. Nobody perfect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, thanks to your Pokédex work,\nthe Professor’s research goin’ GREAT.\rHe even bought a new lab coat. Still no\npants.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r...Just between us, the Professor’s\nshow, Homie Talk, ain’t live! It’s\fprerecorded!\fHe record it in his bathrobe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MAD books. Most covers beat up.\nOne say “Advanced Pantless Living.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a email on the PC.\r...\rAyo, Professor Oak!\nHow your research comin’?\rI’m...doin’ fine. Barely sleepin’.\rI heard {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} gettin’\nquite a reputation.\rThat’s what we hear through the\ngrapevine. I’m hype to hear it.\f           Elm in New Bark Town 8-)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a email on the PC.\r...\rAyo, Professor Oak!\nHow your research comin’?\rI’m...doin’ fine. Barely sleepin’.\rI heard {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} gettin’\nquite a reputation.\rThat’s what we hear through the\ngrapevine. I’m hype to hear it.\f           Elm in New Bark Town 8-)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nGood to see you.\fI heard a lot about you.\rYour Pokédex gotta be close\nto done?\rFor all your hard work,\nI wanna give you somethin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nGood to see you.\fI heard a lot about you.\rYour Pokédex gotta be close\nto done?\rFor all your hard work,\nI wanna give you somethin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Haha!\rWhat’s behind me...\nYou musta figured it out already.\rYes, it’s a homie!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You don’t see these\nmuch in Kanto.\fPick one and it’s yours!\r...Go ’head!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you claimin’ the\nFire homie CHARMANDER? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you decided on the\nWater homie SQUIRTLE? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So you goin’ with\nthe Grass homie BULBASAUR? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This homie got MAD energy!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">No rush.\nTake your time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the\n{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} from Professor Oak!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna give the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\nyou got a street name? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 1, 0}? That’s the street\nname you want? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nYou ain’t got room for it right now.\rCome back when you made room.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: If a wild homie\nshow up, your homie can scrap it.\rWith it by your side, you should\nmake it to the next town...\rWhat am I sayin’?\nYou already know all this!\fHahaha!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Ain’t nothin’ else\nI can do for you.\rEnjoy the rest of your journey\nwith that new homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Professor Oak’s homie.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} PROBABLY won’t steal it like\nlast time... We got a lock now. And a\fdog.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Good to see you!\nThis what I been wantin’ to\fgive you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: That Hidden Machine\ngot the move Wall Climb!\rWhen you teach it to a homie,\nyou can climb rock walls that got\fsteps carved in ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0451_T01R0301_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you use Wall Climb,\nyou can climb rock walls that got\fsteps carved in ’em.\rYou gon’ discover all kinds\nof new stuff!</language>
	</row>
</body>
